<b>解读：</b>电子拥挤度60日分位仅15%处于低位修复区，通信63%中性，但计算机95%+传媒93%处于极度拥挤——公募越跌越加，科技整体筹码压力未解除。流入端通信23亿主力净流入居全行业第一，电子11亿次之；流出端计算机-69亿+传媒-58亿排名全市场前二。资金偏好从软应用向硬上游迁移明确。</div></div></div><div class="card"><h3>行业龙头股拥挤度（各行业成交额前 8）</h3><table><thead><tr><th>行业</th><th>龙头股</th><th>涨跌幅</th><th>成交额(亿)</th><th>换手率</th><th>自由流通换手</th><th>行业成交占比</th><th>拥挤信号</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=nm>电子</td><td class="nm">长鑫科技<div class="cd">688825.SH</div></td><td class="down">-2.25%</td><td>256.7</td><td>11.18%</td><td>11.18%</td><td>3.58%</td><td class="crowd c-mid">偏热</td></tr><tr><td></td><td class="nm">兆易创新<div class="cd">603986.SH</div></td><td class="down">-3.36%</td><td>256.0</td><td>9.51%</td><td>10.25%</td><td>3.57%</td><td class="crowd c-mid">偏热</td></tr><tr><td></td><td class="nm">寒武纪<div class="cd">688256.SH</div></td><td class="down">-6.33%</td><td>237.5</td><td>3.30%</td><td>6.75%</td><td>3.31%</td><td class="crowd c-lo">正常</td></tr><tr><td></td><td class="nm">东山精密<div class="cd">002384.SZ</div></td><td class="down">-4.78%</td><td>190.4</td><td>7.41%</td><td>8.41%</td><td>2.66%</td><td class="crowd c-mid">偏热</td></tr><tr><td></td><td class="nm">胜宏科技<div class="cd">300476.SZ</div></td><td class="up">+2.07%</td><td>169.9</td><td>7.00%</td><td>10.11%</td><td>2.37%</td><td class="crowd c-mid">偏热</td></tr><tr><td></td><td class="nm">生益科技<div class="cd">600183.SH</div></td><td class="down">-1.01%</td><td>130.4</td><td>3.91%</td><td>7.74%</td><td>1.82%</td><td class="crowd c-lo">正常</td></tr><tr><td></td><td class="nm">风华高科<div class="cd">000636.SZ</div></td><td class="up">+5.85%</td><td>125.7</td><td>18.60%</td><td>24.34%</td><td>1.75%</td><td class="crowd c-hi">过热</td></tr><tr><td></td><td class="nm">国瓷材料<div class="cd">300285.SZ</div></td><td class="up">+7.38%</td><td>124.2</td><td>19.77%</td><td>20.69%</td><td>1.73%</td><td class="crowd c-hi">过热</td></tr><tr><td class=nm>通信</td><td class="nm">中际旭创<div class="cd">300308.SZ</div></td><td class="down">-6.01%</td><td>457.6</td><td>4.74%<